{"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.23251027425130211,"h":0.017503492402524912,"y":0.040636042583428567,"x":0.072016467639009443,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"c":1,"w":0.31524472554524741,"y":0.085775184340371013,"x":0.07182769291687853,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.017307009657645311},{"t":"This is an attempt to present the information from both graphs. However, there is","x":0.12109484421287202,"y":0.11446300473860915,"w":0.76192454020182299,"c":1,"h":0.025389045652427611},{"x":0.11904842411534465,"c":1,"h":0.026558527817293731,"t":"inaccurate data, e.g. washing machine use increased by 15%. It actually increased","y":0.1321324027245766,"w":0.78460352579752601},{"c":1,"y":0.14925363724356067,"t":"from 40% in 1920 to just over 70% in 2019. The response focuses on the detail of","x":0.11906399058190392,"w":0.77639821370442696,"h":0.026242043862494402},{"c":1,"w":0.76600499471028649,"y":0.16732868752875829,"h":0.026134722364805296,"t":"when the lines on the graph intersect but there is a lack of clarity in these details.","x":0.12106348439078146},{"t":"The description of the second chart lacks detail. This limits the task achievement.","y":0.18414070355607415,"h":0.026604938844067449,"x":0.12108115965618775,"w":0.77005996704101576,"c":1},{"t":"There is an attempt to present the information in order, and the last line attempts an","y":0.203829913359867,"w":0.79254801432291666,"x":0.12123467456190118,"c":1,"h":0.023744147292857121},{"w":0.76395629882812499,"x":0.1231743455569989,"y":0.2212604710899071,"c":1,"h":0.026311220634110066,"t":"overview. However, there is a lack of coherence caused by missing or inaccurate"},{"t":"cohesive features [Over than] and there is repetition [percentage of household |","y":0.23923861390618939,"h":0.024235641155984311,"x":0.12318583054456998,"c":1,"w":0.75362431844075528},{"h":0.023252483812743252,"w":0.56429890950520822,"t":"number of hours per week] caused by the lack of cohesion.","x":0.12313415549131951,"c":1,"y":0.25887119957761717},{"x":0.12311279652769182,"w":0.76401580810546876,"y":0.29098479084638318,"h":0.026814692152402841,"c":1,"t":"Vocabulary is minimally adequate for the task but there are errors in word choice"},{"t":"[overed by \/ overtaken by] which mean the response is difficult to understand. The","c":1,"x":0.12304401511655044,"y":0.3086545626112176,"w":0.77850840250651032,"h":0.027528030431453132},{"t":"frequency of errors in spelling is also high [percantage \/ percentang \/ percentage","w":0.7660418701171875,"x":0.12315771039484787,"h":0.026565416962856192,"y":0.32708369329978759,"c":1},{"w":0.75978123982747403,"h":0.025721628618184167,"y":0.34498564220468242,"x":0.12320226190439068,"c":1,"t":"| mashine \/ machine | Pefrigerator \/ refrigerator | electical \/ electrical]. The range"},{"c":1,"y":0.36294748683309885,"x":0.12522638496965868,"h":0.025583566007400749,"t":"of grammatical structures is limited. There are some correct examples [all rise","w":0.73720214843749998},{"h":0.028146263005736305,"x":0.12524128362013309,"y":0.38059679249679457,"w":0.76402592976888029,"c":1,"t":"from 1920 to 2019 | they all increase (to) 100 percentage]; however, the errors in"},{"x":0.1251747990664602,"y":0.40117823270496511,"t":"grammar and punctuation mean the response is not clear.","w":0.55202306111653643,"h":0.023802314686410142,"c":1},{"y":0.91279069749145791,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186199,"t":"130","x":0.092592593257865757}],"w":2400,"h":3396}